{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04068","headline":"九月九日望蜀台 · 苏頲","name":"九月九日望蜀台","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"蜀王望蜀旧台前，九日分明见一川。\n北料乡关方自此，南辞城郭复依然。\n青松系马攒岩畔，黄菊留人籍道边。\n自昔登临湮灭尽，独闻忠孝两能传。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"苏頲","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04068.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04068","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}